{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/971533-teen-wolf-w-tf-crossover-fun-thread","id":971533,"title":"Teen Wolf/W:tF crossover [Fun thread]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-17T15:14:24-07:00","id":971533,"title":"Teen Wolf/W:tF crossover [Fun thread]","content":"Exactly as it sounds. How do you think this would end up? To give a hypothetical scenario, a pack of Uratha somehow attract the attention of a Rank 6 spirit which, using its godlike spirity powers, drops them into Teen Wolf-verse. I'm assuming that the Shadow exists there and that the Teen Wolf werewolves simply lack the connection to it that the Uratha have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T21:14:20-07:00","id":971740,"title":"","content":"theres an easy fix to all this. Ignore that the hisil is a mandatory part of werewolves (why it would be is a bit odd as they arent spirits at all either), and just assume that scotts pack hasn't touched it at all. Also assume beacon hills hisil is a real damn mess. <br /> <br /> And Scott is probably a storm lord.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T13:29:56-07:00","id":972681,"title":"","content":"I would just go full on AU and bring most everyone back from the dead to start with (Hales and all) and turn it into an all out Mage/Werewolf crossover. Expand the little we have on emissaries into a full blown nameless order or legacy with a centuries long alliance with the Hales and others who follow their tradition.<br /> <br /> Some headcanons:<br /> - Derek is THE Rahu, either Storm Lord or Blood Talon<br /> - Erica is a Blood Talon Cahalith<br /> - Isaac is a Iron Master Irraka<br /> - Boyd is an Iron Master, unsure what auspice<br /> - Peter is a Bone Shadow, unsure what auspice<br /> - Scott is definitely an Elodoth, unsure what tribe but hes def gots some dots in Destiny<br /> - Derek's totem give them dots in striking looks or Parkour. Probably both. The ban involves doing backflips in stressful situations.<br /> - Stiles is the literal embodiment of someone who would awaken. I can't decide which path though, Acanthus or Mastigos. Awakened because of events surrounding Scott's first change.<br /> - Lydia is a Moros with a decent amount of Fate. Awakened very young after a near death experience involving a werewolf (maybe even Peter still) and as such is the youngest Master (Death) on the west coast.<br /> - Danny is an Obrimos Free Councilor<br /> - Parish is an Obrimos Arrow<br /> - The Nematon was created by an archmage as a means of attracting quintessences. When it started broadcasting, the Hales were able to stake a claim because they had a few Mastigos on the payroll and enough werewolf muscle to fend off other curious mages.<br /> <br /> I may uh, think about this stuff a lot more than is healthy. I also like to think about an AU where Stiles is a Beast who gets devoured before Season 1 and meets Laura Hale before she dies and helps her out in exchange for some advice on what to do with his wolfblooded best friend who has started turning into a wolf on the full moon. Going with the Noghitsune for his Horror seems like a natural fit, but I can never nail down quite what it's hunger would be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","name":"solidork","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T14:28:54-07:00","id":972720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>solidork</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/971533-teen-wolf-w-tf-crossover-fun-thread?p=972681#post972681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would just go full on AU and bring most everyone back from the dead to start with (Hales and all) and turn it into an all out Mage/Werewolf crossover. Expand the little we have on emissaries into a full blown nameless order or legacy with a centuries long alliance with the Hales and others who follow their tradition.<br /> <br /> Some headcanons:<br /> - Derek is THE Rahu, either Storm Lord or Blood Talon<br /> - Erica is a Blood Talon Cahalith<br /> - Isaac is a Iron Master Irraka<br /> - Boyd is an Iron Master, unsure what auspice<br /> - Peter is a Bone Shadow, unsure what auspice<br /> - Scott is definitely an Elodoth, unsure what tribe but hes def gots some dots in Destiny<br /> - Derek's totem give them dots in striking looks or Parkour. Probably both. The ban involves doing backflips in stressful situations.<br /> - Stiles is the literal embodiment of someone who would awaken. I can't decide which path though, Acanthus or Mastigos. Awakened because of events surrounding Scott's first change.<br /> - Lydia is a Moros with a decent amount of Fate. Awakened very young after a near death experience involving a werewolf (maybe even Peter still) and as such is the youngest Master (Death) on the west coast.<br /> - Danny is an Obrimos Free Councilor<br /> - Parish is an Obrimos Arrow<br /> - The Nematon was created by an archmage as a means of attracting quintessences. When it started broadcasting, the Hales were able to stake a claim because they had a few Mastigos on the payroll and enough werewolf muscle to fend off other curious mages.<br /> <br /> I may uh, think about this stuff a lot more than is healthy. I also like to think about an AU where Stiles is a Beast who gets devoured before Season 1 and meets Laura Hale before she dies and helps her out in exchange for some advice on what to do with his wolfblooded best friend who has started turning into a wolf on the full moon. Going with the Noghitsune for his Horror seems like a natural fit, but I can never nail down quite what it's hunger would be.</div> </div> </div> </div>TBH I would have pegged Stiles as an Acanthus, simply for the stupid amount of luck he seems to have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T14:30:31-07:00","id":972721,"title":"","content":"Also, Derek is definitely a Blood Talon. Look at how much time he spends dealing with werewolves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T06:42:20-07:00","id":974374,"title":"","content":"Another thing I can never decide is what Stiles' shadow name would be. &quot;What would your superhero name be?&quot; is definitely something that Scott and Stiles have discussed before, and a scene where they are brainstorming ideas about what name Stiles should use would be really fun. If he was Acanthus, I'm leaning towards Oracle, since it fits the path and is a Batman reference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","name":"solidork","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T07:10:59-07:00","id":974391,"title":"","content":"I peg Scott as a Storm Lord Cahalith myself. Everything since becoming an alpha has really hinged on him becoming greater when fighting for others and making others stronger when fighting for him. <br /> <br /> Liam is Rahu as fuck. Damn near every fight scene involves him going after someone bigger than him and coming out on top. He even used the signature move of Brute Force style on the Beast.<br /> <br /> Malia is a Blood Talon Irraka. Perpetual Loner, but down to kill any and everything for those she cares about.<br /> <br /> I don't really go for the group being Mages. Styles is definitely a Wolf-Blooded with the Open Condition due to his being around werewolves enough and developing a Tell. He likely counts as a Locus with his friends hanging around and getting a charge from him.<br /> <br /> Would definitely dig a Minor Splat for Banshees. Likely make one up this weekend with a few friends online.<br /> <br /> Parish is a weirdass Spirit-Claimed, or probably even a Sin-Eater.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/717-monghani","name":"Monghani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}